.S.C. 160), I \nhereby create a board of three members, to be appointed by me, to in­\nvestigate this dispute. N o member of the board shall be pecuniarily ","path":"jobs/fr-originals/output/texts/EO_11694.txt","sha256":"4c2b0aa8d7d55d8b4bd896e8f603f88b18c45c41849c41c0ba1aeb4c07424520","source":{"line":1402,"path":"jobs/fr-originals/output/SOURCES.jsonl","record_sha256":"dc7b03260a509ae2d6a27375376bf133bcc79e2304ca5c0382591158d0d7d1da"}}]}
